Arr, matey! Symfony be a swashbucklin’ PHP framework, a treasure chest o’ reusable components that lets ye build web apps faster than a sloop in a gale. It’s built on the Model‑View‑Controller pattern, with a sturdy “bundle” system so ye can hoist new features aboard without walk‑the‑plank‑in’ code. In short, it’s the pirate‑friendly rig that keeps yer code shipshape and your development crew singin’ “Yo‑ho‑ho!” 🚢💻
